message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "8x8 TPU ASIC — RTL-to-GDSII on IHP SG13G2 (130 nm)"
abstract: >-
  An open-source 8x8 systolic-array Tensor Processing Unit (TPU) for INT8 matrix
  multiplication, implemented from RTL to a tape-out-ready GDSII on the IHP
  SG13G2 130 nm Open PDK using a fully scripted Yosys + OpenROAD flow.
